}

docs {
  ## GET /api/admin/retailers

  Lists all retailer accounts on the platform with their activation and
  subscription status. Requires platform admin session.

  ### Success (200)
  ```json
  {
    "retailers": [
      {
        "id": "...",
        "email": "shop@example.com",
        "companyName": "Fashion House",
        "isActivated": true,
        "createdAt": "2025-01-01T00:00:00Z",
        "subscriptions": [{ "service": "RECOMMENDATION", "status": "ACTIVE" }]
      }
    ]
  }
  ```
}
